## 🧪 3. Network Troubleshooting & Diagnostics

### `ping`
- Tests reachability of a host.
```bash
ping 8.8.8.8
ping google.com
```

### `traceroute`
- Traces route packets take to destination.
```bash
traceroute google.com
```

### `netstat` / `ss`
- Displays network connections, routing tables, interface stats.
```bash
netstat -tuln
ss -tuln
```

### `dig` / `nslookup`
- DNS lookup tools.
```bash
dig google.com
nslookup google.com
```

### `host`
- Simple DNS lookup.
```bash
host google.com
```

### `curl` / `wget`
- Fetches content from web servers.
```bash
curl http://example.com
wget http://example.com/file.zip
```

